{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら4月なってました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフール逃した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘つきたかった( ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで\nブログの更新しばらくあきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメでは\nしばらく送れませんって話をしてたので\nわかったかもしれないけど\nブログでは言ってなかったよね＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーと、\nこの度\n台湾行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に\n帰国してすぐに書いてますので\nこの『ただいまー！！！！』のリアリティはすごいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです、\nもうご存知のかたもいるとは思いますが\n乃木團でライブしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観光もしてきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その模様は\n来月くらいの のぎ天 で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ帰国しまして\nさっそく明日は個別です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾いったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エイプリルフール嘘ついた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のスペシャル個別\n待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/03/6998278/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}